{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127215214051-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127225446\"/><p>筲箕灣耀興道33號東駿苑一單位，今日(27日)下午2時19分，一名姓林(39歲)男住戶懷疑在屋內暈倒，由家人發現後報案。救援人員奉召上門，惜事主當場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。案件列作「屍體發現」處理。消息指，事主懷疑在家中跌倒後失救致死。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:03:58.452390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:52:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.250889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:57:21.531624+00:00","content_hash":"f58177fcd160a54fddf1ba35639870a35db7b15454bea22b7ebc8732d2675e08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:03:58.452390+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}